{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abyss Veil is a genre-bending first-person shooter / visual novel that retraces the lives of Ivy, Mel and many others in a war torn world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ivy searches for her brother, the only person in her life who she could find solace in. They both shared a common dream with their friends... What was it? Anyway, she is now part of the Whitehounds, a fate perhaps worse than death itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mel ran away from Mars during the war, leaving everyone behind to live as a mercenary. She's now a Knight pilot in a shady mercenary group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History was erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power was rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/297cbe85e7555e63b9437a4749d0ac3f.avif?t=1768956284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras_big/297cbe85e7555e63b9437a4749d0ac3f.avif?t=1768956284 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World To Erase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first inter-planetary war between the families under the United Nations of Earth (UNE) and the Democratic Republic of Mars (DRM) has been raging for years. The Empress has gone silent. The balance of power between the families has shifted, and hostility grows from within. What could possibly lie behind the veil ? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/7ea853ea59ca428eba8b3a2efb020de6.avif?t=1768956284\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lily Archipelago</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gangs, mercenaries and the Menodora family are constantly clashing for power accross Lily Archipelago, the main region Abyss Veil is set in. Each island has its own rules, vices, and beliefs! But one thing remains true: no matter the blood spilled, the archipelago has never bowed to the UNE! Crazy stuff!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/bc2df0eb2d35699232599a0e6f95d5eb.avif?t=1768956284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras_big/bc2df0eb2d35699232599a0e6f95d5eb.avif?t=1768956284 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EasyVacation Action Package</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EasyVacation will take you on a tour of its many sights, from the bombastic warfare you\u2019ll take part in, to the horrifying secrets deep within the archipelago. One thing\u2019s for sure: fun is guaranteed. Survival is optional!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: EasyVacation is not responsible for your welfare. If you experience PTSD, war-related trauma, or existential dread, please consider it part of the intended experience!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/0b5ba5f39607a79bc93d7559a85afdf8.avif?t=1768956284\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Decay Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668430/99bf812609aef9696ebc6fbcdb37d99f33603c04.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1: Decay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668430/99bf812609aef9696ebc6fbcdb37d99f33603c04.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668430?t=1768956284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668430?t=1768956284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/d6d2f5446bd5dce748f1f967e7fbbe05875f0f7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768956284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/d6d2f5446bd5dce748f1f967e7fbbe05875f0f7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768956284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent violence and gore, strong language, depictions of depression and bright flashing imagery. "},"demos":[{"appid":3928110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abyss Veil is a genre-bending first-person shooter / visual novel that retraces the lives of Ivy, Mel and many others in a war torn world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ivy searches for her brother, the only person in her life who she could find solace in. They both shared a common dream with their friends... What was it? Anyway, she is now part of the Whitehounds, a fate perhaps worse than death itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mel ran away from Mars during the war, leaving everyone behind to live as a mercenary. She's now a Knight pilot in a shady mercenary group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History was erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power was rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/297cbe85e7555e63b9437a4749d0ac3f.avif?t=1768956284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras_big/297cbe85e7555e63b9437a4749d0ac3f.avif?t=1768956284 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World To Erase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first inter-planetary war between the families under the United Nations of Earth (UNE) and the Democratic Republic of Mars (DRM) has been raging for years. The Empress has gone silent. The balance of power between the families has shifted, and hostility grows from within. What could possibly lie behind the veil ? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/7ea853ea59ca428eba8b3a2efb020de6.avif?t=1768956284\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lily Archipelago</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gangs, mercenaries and the Menodora family are constantly clashing for power accross Lily Archipelago, the main region Abyss Veil is set in. Each island has its own rules, vices, and beliefs! But one thing remains true: no matter the blood spilled, the archipelago has never bowed to the UNE! Crazy stuff!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/bc2df0eb2d35699232599a0e6f95d5eb.avif?t=1768956284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras_big/bc2df0eb2d35699232599a0e6f95d5eb.avif?t=1768956284 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EasyVacation Action Package</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EasyVacation will take you on a tour of its many sights, from the bombastic warfare you\u2019ll take part in, to the horrifying secrets deep within the archipelago. One thing\u2019s for sure: fun is guaranteed. Survival is optional!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: EasyVacation is not responsible for your welfare. If you experience PTSD, war-related trauma, or existential dread, please consider it part of the intended experience!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/extras/0b5ba5f39607a79bc93d7559a85afdf8.avif?t=1768956284\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Zorrio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668430/0c1998cc9526d20af73448bde1bf2a3be75db6f0/header.jpg?t=1768956284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668430/423026236/ae547e9275d0cfa06e9e233a0feaeb5a87e3c2a8/1763416986/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763419124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668430/423026236/ae547e9275d0cfa06e9e233a0feaeb5a87e3c2a8/1763416986/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763419124","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668430/423026236/ae547e9275d0cfa06e9e233a0feaeb5a87e3c2a8/1763416986/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763419124","id":257233550,"name":"Abyss Veil - Opening","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257233550/ddcc428f5453003942a3dd8c869d6a21b4950c42/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763419124"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668430/1466029854/bc0cab47b8b91f1817f1323ffc0aabf35f753561/1762205883/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763419125","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668430/1466029854/bc0cab47b8b91f1817f1323ffc0aabf35f753561/1762205883/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763419125","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3668430/1466029854/bc0cab47b8b91f1817f1323ffc0aabf35f753561/1762205883/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=17634